DreamPointerEventData:ClickCount {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:ClickCount
    src   "How many clicks this pointer has landed on the same widget in an unbroken run: 1 for a single\nclick, 2 for the second of a double, and so on. Reset to 1 by a press on a different widget from\nthe last click, with a different button, too late (see UDreamEventSystem::DoubleClickTime), or\nfarther from where the last click was pressed than the press raycaster's drag threshold.\n\nCounted at the PRESS, and the click that press ends in carries the same number, so a down, a\ndouble click and a click all read one answer. Every even press is dispatched as a double click\ninstead of a down, which is how a triple click reads as down, double, down and a quadruple as two\ndoubles -- the same shape as the desktop."
    text  "此指针在同一控件上不中断地连续点击的次数：单击为1，\n双击的第二次为2，依此类推。以下情况会将其重置为1：按下的控件与上次点击不同、\n按键与上次点击不同、间隔太久（参见 UDreamEventSystem::DoubleClickTime），或\n按下位置与上次点击按下位置的距离超过按下射线检测器的拖动阈值。\n\n在按下时计数，该次按下最终形成的点击携带相同的数字，因此按下、\n双击和单击读到的都是同一个答案。每次偶数次按下都会作为双击派发，\n而不是按下，因此三击读作按下、双击、按下，四击读作两次双击\n——与桌面上的行为相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamPointerEventData:ClickTime {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:ClickTime
    src   "When this pointer's last click landed -- the release that completed it -- in seconds on the\npointer clock (UDreamEventSystem::GetPointerClockSeconds: the world's real time, which a pause\ndoes not stop and time dilation does not stretch). The next press measures the double-click\nwindow from it."
    text  "此指针上次点击落下的时刻（完成该次点击的释放）——以秒为单位，基于\n指针时钟（UDreamEventSystem::GetPointerClockSeconds：世界的真实时间，暂停\n不会使其停止，时间膨胀也不会将其拉伸）。下一次按下以此为起点衡量双击\n时间窗口。"
    state machine
}

DreamPointerEventData:DragOperation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:DragOperation
    src   "What this drag MEANS -- payload, tag, drag visual. Set by the drag's source when it begins\n(UDreamUIDragSource does), read by drop targets, cleared wherever DragWidget is: it lives\nexactly as long as the drag. Null for a drag nothing gave meaning to (a scroll, a slider)."
    text  "此拖动意味着什么——载荷、标签、拖动视觉。由拖动源在拖动开始时设置\n（UDreamUIDragSource 会这样做），由放置目标读取，在清除 DragWidget 控件的地方一并清除：\n它的生命周期与拖动完全一致。未赋予任何含义的拖动（滚动、滑块）为 null。"
    state machine
}

