DreamPointerEventData:FaceIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:FaceIndex
    src   "current hit object's triangle face index.\nFor UI element, only valid when target's RaycastType is Geometry.\nFor world space static mesh, only valid when DreamWorldSpaceRaycaster->bRequireFaceIndex is true."
    text  "当前命中对象的三角形面索引。\n对于 UI 元素，仅当目标的 RaycastType 为 Geometry 时有效。\n对于世界空间静态网格体，仅当 DreamWorldSpaceRaycaster->bRequireFaceIndex 为 true 时有效。"
    state machine
}

DreamPointerEventData:GetLocalPointInPlane {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:GetLocalPointInPlane
    src   "Use a line-plane intersection to get world point, and convert to pressComponent's local space. The plane is pressComponent's x-axis plane."
    text  "通过线面相交计算世界坐标点，并转换到 pressComponent 组件的局部空间。该平面为 pressComponent 组件的 x 轴平面。"
