DreamPointerEventData:GetWorldPointSpherical {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:GetWorldPointSpherical
    src   "Use (ray direction) * (press line distance) + (ray origin) to calculated world point, so the result is a sphere with (ray origin) as center point."
    text  "使用 (射线方向) * (按压线距离) + (射线原点) 计算世界坐标点，因此结果是以 (射线原点) 为球心的球面。"
    state machine
}

DreamPointerEventData:HitWidgetIgnoringEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:HitWidgetIgnoringEnabled
    src   "The widget drawn on top under the pointer, enabled or not, as of the pointer's latest trace; null over nothing.\n\nIt is EnterWidget, or a widget inside EnterWidget when the pointer is over a disabled one: a disabled widget and\neverything in it are cut out of the path under the pointer, which then ends at the nearest widget above them\nthat takes input (FHittestGrid::GetBubblePath) -- EnterWidget, which is hovered, pressed and clicked. Slate still\nlooks for a tooltip under the cursor including disabled widgets (FSlateUser::UpdateTooltip), and so does\nUDreamUITooltipSubsystem, from here."
    text  "指针下方最上层绘制的控件，无论是否启用，以指针最近一次追踪为准；指针下无内容时为 null。\n\n它是 EnterWidget，或当指针位于禁用控件上时，是 EnterWidget 内部的某个控件：禁用控件及其\n内部所有内容都会从指针下方的路径中剔除，路径随后终止于它们上方最近一个\n接收输入的控件（FHittestGrid::GetBubblePath）——即 EnterWidget，它被悬停、按下和点击。Slate 仍\n会在光标下查找工具提示，其中包含禁用控件（FSlateUser::UpdateTooltip），UDreamUITooltipSubsystem\n也是如此。"
    state machine
}

DreamPointerEventData:HoverComponentArray {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:HoverComponentArray
    src   "a collection that current pointer hovering objects. the top most one stay at index 0 in array."
    text  "当前指针悬停对象的集合。最上层的对象位于数组索引 0 处。"
