DreamPointerEventData:LastClickMouseButtonType {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:LastClickMouseButtonType
    src   "Which button the previous click was made with. A run is one button's, as a desktop double click\nis: a left click and a quick right press are two single presses, not a double click -- which\nmatters now that the second press of a double click is delivered as the double click and not as\na down, since a right press read as a left double click would never reach anything as a press."
    text  "上一次点击是用哪个按钮发出的。一次连续点击属于同一个按钮，正如桌面双击\n那样：一次左键点击加一次快速右键按下是两次单次按下，而不是双击——这一点\n现在很重要，因为双击的第二次按下会作为双击传递而不是作为一次按下，否则\n被读作左键双击的右键按下将永远无法作为按下事件到达任何对象。"
    state machine
}

DreamPointerEventData:LastClickPressPointerPosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:LastClickPressPointerPosition
    src   "Where the previous click was PRESSED, in the pointer's screen position (its PressPointerPosition).\nA second press only continues the run if it lands within the press raycaster's drag threshold of\nthis -- see UDreamBaseRaycaster::IsWithinDoubleClickDistance."
    text  "上一次点击按下的位置，以指针的屏幕位置表示（其 PressPointerPosition）。\n第二次按下只有落在此位置附近的按压射线检测器拖拽阈值之内，才会延续该次连续点击\n——参见 UDreamBaseRaycaster::IsWithinDoubleClickDistance。"
    state machine
}

