DreamPointerEventData:PressTime {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Event/DreamPointerEventData.h#DreamPointerEventData:PressTime
    src   "When the trigger last went down, on the pointer clock (see ClickTime). Long press and hold-to-drag\nmeasure the hold as the pointer clock's current time minus this, so compare it against that clock\n-- never against the game clock (GetTimeSeconds), which a pause stops while the UI keeps running."
    text  "上次触发器按下时的时间，基于指针时钟（参见 ClickTime）。长按和按住拖拽\n将按住时长计算为指针时钟的当前时间减去此值，因此请与指针时钟比较\n——切勿与游戏时钟（GetTimeSeconds）比较，暂停会使其停止，而 UI 仍在运行。"
    state machine
}

